  maxHealth: 500
  contactDamage: 1
  scoreReward: 5000
  description: Rules on behalf of a king nobody has seen in years. The arrangement
    suits him. The knight asking questions does not.
  tactics: 'Guarded by two Blades - he is untouchable and firing the whole time you
    duel them. Then three courts: fans and triples, dense rings below 55%, and a
    Scorched Court under a quarter where storm crosses sweep between walls. The endgame
    drill: kill the guard, bank a ward, spend it late.'
  displayName: The Regent
